WEBVTT

00:08:26.496 --> 00:08:30.746
I had a lot of similar experiences
so that a lot of

00:08:30.746 --> 00:08:35.412
the questions I'm going to ask you are
really not only for my listeners benefit,

00:08:35.412 --> 00:08:40.037
but also for my own in
terms of really being

00:08:40.037 --> 00:08:46.912
so curious about how somebody can emerge
from that kind of darkness to be able

00:08:46.912 --> 00:08:52.496
to. Say, this is happiness, you know,
this is happiness. Mm hmm.

00:08:52.996 --> 00:08:57.412
You've written this about what a father's
role is in his children's life.

00:08:58.037 --> 00:09:01.537
The father's job is to teach his
children how to be warriors,